### Pictures of authors.

## What of an address cannot be asked: each follows "not an address that can be asked: ".

avatars-service-address-question = a question in the service's address
avatars-the-hash = the hash
avatars-redirect-away-from-service = a redirect away from the service
avatars-redirect-away-from-https = a redirect away from HTTPS

## What of an answer cannot be read: each follows "the answer is not one that can be read: ".

avatars-redirect-to-nowhere = a redirect to nowhere
avatars-too-many-redirects = too many redirects
